      "id": "take_break_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "休憩しよう。これは逃げじゃなくて、ちゃんと整える時間。",
      "translatedText": "Let us take a break. This is not running away; it is time to reset properly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "take_break_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "take_break_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "水を飲んで、画面から少しだけ目を離して。私、ここで待ってるから。",
      "translatedText": "Drink some water and look away from the screen for a little. I will wait here.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "take_break_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "take_break_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "戻る時のために、次に開く場所だけメモしておくと安心だよ。",
      "translatedText": "For when you return, it helps to note the next place to open.",
      "emotion": "thinking",
      "presentation": {
